                <h2>适用场景</h2>
<p>本文适用于以下情况：<br />
- 同时运营多个海外广告平台账户<br />
- 每月需完成广告消耗与财务账目核对<br />
- 需要管理多个账户的充值记录和发票<br />
- 财务团队对账时经常发现差异</p>
<hr />
<h2>步骤一：建立账户台账表</h2>
<p><strong>操作方法：</strong></p>
<p>在开始对账前，先整理一份账户台账表，包含以下字段：</p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>字段</th>
<th>说明</th>
<th>示例</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>平台</td>
<td>广告平台名称</td>
<td>Meta / Google / TikTok</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>账户ID</td>
<td>代理商分配的账户编号</td>
<td>USxxxxxx</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>账户名称</td>
<td>便于识别的简称</td>
<td>某App北美主力户</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>代理商</td>
<td>开户代理商名称</td>
<td>以渔数媒</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>充值方式</td>
<td>预付款/月结</td>
<td>预付款</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>账户余额</td>
<td>当前剩余额度</td>
<td>$1,250.00</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<blockquote>
<p><strong>提示：</strong> 建议在每月1日更新账户余额，便于后续消耗计算。</p>
</blockquote>
<hr />
<h2>步骤二：充值记录同步</h2>
<p><strong>操作方法：</strong></p>
<p>从代理商后台或邮件通知中提取本月所有充值记录，填入对账表。</p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>日期</th>
<th>账户</th>
<th>金额(USD)</th>
<th>凭证号</th>
<th>来源</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>12/05</td>
<td>USxxxxxx</td>
<td>$500</td>
<td>INV-20241205-001</td>
<td>以渔后台</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>12/12</td>
<td>USxxxxxx</td>
<td>$300</td>
<td>INV-20241212-002</td>
<td>邮件通知</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p><strong>核验要点：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>充值金额与代理商出具的账单是否一致</li>
<li>汇率是否按约定标准计算（涉及人民币换算时）</li>
<li>充值到账时间与记录时间是否匹配</li>
</ul>
<hr />
<h2>步骤三：消耗数据核对</h2>
<p><strong>操作方法：</strong></p>
<p>登录各平台后台，导出本月广告消耗报告。</p>
<ol>
<li><strong>Meta Business Manager</strong>：进入广告管理后台 → 报告 → 导出本月数据</li>
<li><strong>Google Ads</strong>：工具与设置 → 报告 → 下载报告</li>
<li><strong>TikTok Ads</strong>：数据中心 → 报告 → 消耗报表</li>
</ol>
<p><strong>核对公式：</strong></p>
<pre><code>期末余额 = 期初余额 + 本月充值 - 本月消耗
</code></pre>
<p><strong>常见差异及原因：</strong></p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>差异类型</th>
<th>可能原因</th>
<th>处理方式</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>余额为负</td>
<td>存在待结算消耗</td>
<td>等待24小时后重新核对</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>消耗超出充值</td>
<td>月结账户或信用额度</td>
<td>确认账单周期</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>金额相差几美元</td>
<td>平台汇率波动</td>
<td>记录为汇兑差额</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<hr />
<h2>步骤四：发票收集与核对</h2>
<p><strong>操作方法：</strong></p>
<p>将收到的发票按账户分类，检查以下信息：</p>
<ul>
<li>[ ] 发票金额与充值记录一致</li>
<li>[ ] 发票抬头公司名称正确</li>
<li>[ ] 开票日期在充值之后</li>
<li>[ ] 发票代码、号码可查验</li>
<li>[ ] 对应消耗明细已附上（如需要）</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>归类存档：</strong></p>
<p>建议按以下结构存档：</p>
<pre><code>2024年度广告发票/
├── 01月/
│   ├── Meta_202401.pdf
│   ├── Google_202401.pdf
│   └── TikTok_202401.pdf
├── 02月/
│   └── ...
</code></pre>
<hr />
<h2>步骤五：差异分析与处理</h2>
<p><strong>处理流程：</strong></p>
<ol>
<li><strong>差异金额 ≤ $10</strong>：记录备注，可直接结转</li>
<li><strong>差异金额 $10-$100</strong>：联系代理商核查，保留沟通记录</li>
<li><strong>差异金额 &gt; $100</strong>：提交平台后台申诉或代理商对账请求</li>
</ol>
<p><strong>必要留存材料：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>充值截图/邮件</li>
<li>平台消耗后台截图</li>
<li>与代理商的沟通记录</li>
<li>差异说明文档</li>
</ul>
<hr />
<h2>步骤六：完成月度对账报表</h2>
<p>完成以上步骤后，汇总输出月度对账汇总表，包含：</p>
<ul>
<li>各账户充值总额</li>
<li>各账户消耗总额</li>
<li>期末余额汇总</li>
<li>发票收到情况</li>
<li>未处理差异说明</li>
</ul>
<blockquote>
<p><strong>建议：</strong> 在每月10日前完成上月对账，确保在财务结算周期内完成所有核对工作。</p>
</blockquote>
<hr />
<h2>常见问题</h2>
<p><strong>Q：充值后余额未立即更新怎么办？</strong></p>
<p>海外平台通常有5-30分钟的到账延迟，建议充值后等待30分钟再核对余额。</p>
<p><strong>Q：发票金额与充值金额不一致怎么入账？</strong></p>
<p>以平台实际消耗金额为准，发票金额可能因汇率或手续费略有差异，在财务备注中说明即可。</p>
<p><strong>Q：多账户对账工作量大，有什么工具推荐？</strong></p>
<p>可使用以渔数媒的多账户管理后台，一站式查看所有账户的充值、消耗和余额状态，减少人工切换核对的时间成本。</p>
            </div>
            <div class="prose max-w-none" x-show="lang === 'en'" x-cloak>
                <h2>Applicable Scenarios</h2>
<p>This SOP is designed for teams that:</p>
<ul>
<li>Operate multiple overseas ad platform accounts simultaneously</li>
<li>Need to reconcile monthly ad spend with financial records</li>
<li>Manage recharge records and invoices across various accounts</li>
<li>Experience frequent discrepancies during finance reconciliation</li>
</ul>
<hr />
<h2>Step 1: Build an Account Registry</h2>
<p><strong>Procedure:</strong></p>
<p>Before starting reconciliation, create an account registry with the following fields:</p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Field</th>
<th>Description</th>
<th>Example</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>Platform</td>
<td>Ad platform name</td>
<td>Meta / Google / TikTok</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Account ID</td>
<td>Agency-assigned account number</td>
<td>USxxxxxx</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Account Name</td>
<td>Easy-to-identify nickname</td>
<td>App North America Primary</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Agency</td>
<td>Account opening agency</td>
<td>Yiyu Media</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Payment Type</td>
<td>Prepay / Monthly</td>
<td>Prepay</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Balance</td>
<td>Current remaining credit</td>
<td>$1,250.00</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<blockquote>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Update account balances on the 1st of each month for easier spend calculation.</p>
</blockquote>
<hr />
<h2>Step 2: Sync Recharge Records</h2>
<p><strong>Procedure:</strong></p>
<p>Extract all monthly recharge records from the agency backend or email notifications and input them into the reconciliation sheet.</p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Date</th>
<th>Account</th>
<th>Amount(USD)</th>
<th>Reference No.</th>
<th>Source</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>12/05</td>
<td>USxxxxxx</td>
<td>$500</td>
<td>INV-20241205-001</td>
<td>Agency Backend</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>12/12</td>
<td>USxxxxxx</td>
<td>$300</td>
<td>INV-20241212-002</td>
<td>Email Notification</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p><strong>Verification Points:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Verify recharge amounts match agency invoices</li>
<li>Check exchange rates match agreed standards (for CNY conversions)</li>
<li>Confirm arrival time matches record time</li>
</ul>
<hr />
<h2>Step 3: Verify Spend Data</h2>
<p><strong>Procedure:</strong></p>
<p>Log into each platform backend and export monthly ad spend reports.</p>
<ol>
<li><strong>Meta Business Manager</strong>: Ads Manager → Reports → Export monthly data</li>
<li><strong>Google Ads</strong>: Tools &amp; Settings → Reports → Download report</li>
<li><strong>TikTok Ads</strong>: Data Center → Reports → Spend report</li>
</ol>
<p><strong>Reconciliation Formula:</strong></p>
<pre><code>Ending Balance = Beginning Balance + Monthly Recharge - Monthly Spend
</code></pre>
<p><strong>Common Discrepancies and Causes:</strong></p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Discrepancy Type</th>
<th>Possible Cause</th>
<th>Resolution</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>Negative balance</td>
<td>Pending settlement spend</td>
<td>Wait 24 hours and recheck</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Spend exceeds recharge</td>
<td>Monthly billing or credit line</td>
<td>Confirm billing cycle</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Minor difference (few dollars)</td>
<td>Platform FX fluctuation</td>
<td>Record as exchange variance</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<hr />
<h2>Step 4: Collect and Verify Invoices</h2>
<p><strong>Procedure:</strong></p>
<p>Organize received invoices by account and verify:</p>
<ul>
<li>[ ] Invoice amount matches recharge record</li>
<li>[ ] Invoice company name is correct</li>
<li>[ ] Invoice date is after recharge date</li>
<li>[ ] Invoice code and number are verifiable</li>
<li>[ ] Corresponding spend details attached (if required)</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Archive Organization:</strong></p>
<p>Recommended folder structure:</p>
<pre><code>2024 Ad Invoices/
├── 01/
│   ├── Meta_202401.pdf
│   ├── Google_202401.pdf
│   └── TikTok_202401.pdf
├── 02/
│   └── ...
</code></pre>
<hr />
<h2>Step 5: Analyze and Resolve Discrepancies</h2>
<p><strong>Resolution Process:</strong></p>
<ol>
<li><strong>Difference ≤ $10</strong>: Note in comments, proceed to close</li>
<li><strong>Difference $10-$100</strong>: Contact agency for verification, retain communication records</li>
<li><strong>Difference &gt; $100</strong>: Submit platform ticket or agency reconciliation request</li>
</ol>
<p><strong>Required Documentation:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Recharge screenshots/emails</li>
<li>Platform spend backend screenshots</li>
<li>Communication records with agency</li>
<li>Discrepancy explanation document</li>
</ul>
<hr />
<h2>Step 6: Complete Monthly Reconciliation Report</h2>
<p>After completing the above steps, compile a monthly reconciliation summary including:</p>
<ul>
<li>Total recharge by account</li>
<li>Total spend by account</li>
<li>Ending balance summary</li>
<li>Invoice receipt status</li>
<li>Unexplained discrepancies</li>
</ul>
<blockquote>
<p><strong>Recommendation:</strong> Complete previous month's reconciliation by the 10th to ensure closure within the financial settlement cycle.</p>
</blockquote>
<hr />
<h2>FAQ</h2>
<p><strong>Q: What if balance doesn't update after recharge?</strong></p>
<p>Overseas platforms typically have a 5-30 minute arrival delay. Wait 30 minutes after recharge before checking balance.</p>
<p><strong>Q: How to handle invoice amounts not matching recharge amounts?</strong></p>
<p>Use platform actual spend as the basis. Invoice amounts may vary slightly due to exchange rates or fees—note this in financial comments.</p>
<p><strong>Q: Any tools to reduce multi-account reconciliation workload?</strong></p>
<p>Use Yiyu Media's multi-account management backend to view all account recharge, spend, and balance statuses in one place, reducing manual switching time.</p>
